---
<BaseLayout {title} {description} {canonical} image={article.coverUrl} ogType="article" publishedTime={article.publishedAt} modifiedTime={article.publishedAt} {jsonLd}>
  <nav class="blog-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-aria-en="Breadcrumb" data-aria-zh="面包屑">
    <a href="/" data-en="Home" data-zh="首页">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/blog/" data-en="Blog" data-zh="博客">Blog</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page" data-en="Champions without prestige chroma" data-zh="还没有臻彩原画的英雄">Champions without prestige chroma</span>
  </nav>

  <article class="blog-article" data-language-content="en">
    <header class="article-header"><p class="kicker">LoL PRESTIGE CHROMA TRACKER</p><h1>{article.titleEn}</h1><p class="article-deck">As of Patch 26.14, 105 out of 173 champions have received prestige chroma splash art. Here are the 68 still waiting.</p><p class="article-meta"><time datetime={article.publishedAt}>{formatBlogDate(article.publishedAt, 'en')}</time><span>·</span><span>{article.readingMinutes} min read</span></p></header>
    <figure><img src={article.coverUrl} alt={article.coverAltEn} data-alt-en={article.coverAltEn} data-alt-zh={article.coverAltZh} data-fallback="/placeholder.svg" data-placeholder="/placeholder.svg" width="1788" height="880" loading="eager" decoding="async" /><figcaption>The Prestige Chroma Collection — 105 champions and counting.</figcaption></figure>

    <section><h2>Overview</h2><p>Prestige chroma splash art is a pretty exclusive cosmetic in League of Legends — it gives certain skin chromas their own brand-new splash art (<a href="/blog/what-are-prestige-chromas/">full guide</a>). Patch 26.14 brought the total to 105 champions covered, which means 68 are still missing out.</p><p>Note: regular <a href="/blog/what-are-chroma-skins/">chroma skins</a> only shift the colour palette — prestige chromas go further with entirely new illustrations.</p><p>Below is every champion that <strong>doesn't have</strong> a prestige chroma splash art yet.</p></section>

    <section><h2>Complete list</h2><p>68 champions, sorted by when they hit the Rift:</p></section>
    <ul class="champion-list">
      {champions.map((c, i) => <li><span class="champ-id">{i + 1}.</span><img class="champ-avatar" src={`/img/champions/${c.alias}.png`} alt="" width="32" height="32" loading="lazy" decoding="async" aria-hidden="true" /><span class="champ-name" data-en={c.en} data-zh={c.zh}>{c.en}</span></li>)}
    </ul>

    <section><h2>By the numbers</h2>
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card"><span class="stat-number">173</span><span class="stat-label" data-en="Total champions" data-zh="英雄总数">Total champions</span></div>
        <div class="stat-card"><span class="stat-number">105</span><span class="stat-label" data-en="With prestige chroma" data-zh="已有臻彩原画">With prestige chroma</span></div>
        <div class="stat-card"><span class="stat-number">68</span><span class="stat-label" data-en="Still waiting" data-zh="仍在等待">Still waiting</span></div>
        <div class="stat-card"><span class="stat-number">60.7%</span><span class="stat-label" data-en="Coverage rate" data-zh="覆盖率">Coverage rate</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq"><h2>FAQ</h2><details><summary>When will new prestige chroma splash art be released?</summary><p>Riot hasn't announced a fixed schedule, but the Chinese server may add new ones with patch updates.</p></details><details><summary>Will older prestige chromas come back?</summary><p>Some older prestige chromas rotate into the Mythic Shop periodically. There is no guarantee for every past chroma, but the pattern suggests select returns over time.</p></details><details><summary>What is the difference between prestige chromas and regular chromas?</summary><p>Prestige chromas are also chromas — but each one comes with its own beautifully illustrated splash art. See our <a href="/blog/what-are-prestige-chromas/">prestige chroma guide</a> for the full breakdown.</p></details><details><summary>How does the Prestige Chroma Collection system work?</summary><p>The in-client Collection system lets you view, organise, and showcase your prestige chromas. You can curate a personal gallery and compare progress on the server ranking. See our <a href="/blog/what-are-prestige-chromas/">detailed guide</a> for how it works.</p></details></section>
  </article>

  <article class="blog-article" data-language-content="zh">
    <header class="article-header"><p class="kicker">LoL 臻彩原画追踪</p><h1>{article.titleZh}</h1><p class="article-deck">截至 26.14 版本，173 位英雄中已有 105 位获得臻彩原画，还有 68 位仍在等待。</p><p class="article-meta"><time datetime={article.publishedAt}>{formatBlogDate(article.publishedAt, 'zh')}</time><span>·</span><span>阅读约 {article.readingMinutes} 分钟</span></p></header>
    <figure><img src={article.coverUrl} alt={article.coverAltZh} data-alt-en={article.coverAltEn} data-alt-zh={article.coverAltZh} data-fallback="/placeholder.svg" data-placeholder="/placeholder.svg" width="1788" height="880" loading="eager" decoding="async" /><figcaption>臻彩藏馆——已有 105 位英雄入选。</figcaption></figure>

    <section><h2>概览</h2><p>臻彩原画算是《英雄联盟》里比较稀缺的视觉内容了——简单说就是给部分皮肤的炫彩配色单独画了一幅新原画（<a href="/blog/what-are-prestige-chromas/">详细介绍</a>）。26.14 版本更新后，已经有 105 位英雄入选，还有 68 位没轮上。</p><p>补充一下：普通<a href="/blog/what-are-chroma-skins/">炫彩皮肤</a>只是换配色，臻彩则直接配上全新原画。</p><p>下面就是目前<strong>还没有</strong>臻彩原画的英雄。</p></section>

    <section><h2>完整名单</h2><p>68 位英雄，按上线时间从早到晚排列：</p></section>
    <ul class="champion-list">
      {champions.map((c, i) => <li><span class="champ-id">{i + 1}.</span><img class="champ-avatar" src={`/img/champions/${c.alias}.png`} alt="" width="32" height="32" loading="lazy" decoding="async" aria-hidden="true" /><span class="champ-name" data-en={c.en} data-zh={c.zh}>{c.en}</span></li>)}
    </ul>

    <section><h2>数据一览</h2>
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card"><span class="stat-number">173</span><span class="stat-label" data-en="Total champions" data-zh="英雄总数">英雄总数</span></div>
        <div class="stat-card"><span class="stat-number">105</span><span class="stat-label" data-en="With prestige chroma" data-zh="已有臻彩原画">已有臻彩原画</span></div>
        <div class="stat-card"><span class="stat-number">68</span><span class="stat-label" data-en="Still waiting" data-zh="仍在等待">仍在等待</span></div>
        <div class="stat-card"><span class="stat-number">60.7%</span><span class="stat-label" data-en="Coverage rate" data-zh="覆盖率">覆盖率</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq"><h2>常见问题解答</h2><details><summary>臻彩原画什么时候会新增？</summary><p>官方没有公布固定时间表，国服可能会在版本更新中新增臻彩原画。</p></details><details><summary>往期的臻彩还会返场吗？</summary><p>部分往期臻彩会不定期进入神话商店轮换。并非所有历史臻彩都会返场，但已有先例表明部分臻彩会随时间回归。</p></details><details><summary>臻彩和普通炫彩有什么区别？</summary><p>臻彩也是炫彩，但每个臻彩都将拥有一张精美的原画。详见我们的<a href="/blog/what-are-prestige-chromas/">臻彩专题</a>。</p></details><details><summary>臻彩藏馆系统怎么用？</summary><p>客户端内打开臻彩藏馆即可查看、整理和展示自己的收藏，还能自定义个人主页的臻彩展示。详见我们的<a href="/blog/what-are-prestige-chromas/">详细介绍</a>。</p></details></section>
  </article>

  <BlogAdjacentNavigation currentSlug={article.slug} />

  <style>
    .blog-breadcrumbs,.blog-article{width:min(760px,calc(100% - (var(--page-gutter) * 2)));margin-inline:auto}.blog-breadcrumbs{display:flex;gap:9px;padding:28px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.84rem;white-space:nowrap;overflow-x:auto}.blog-article{padding:clamp(52px,8vw,90px) 0 110px}.article-header,.blog-article>section,.blog-article>figure,.blog-article>ul,.stats-grid{width:100%;margin-inline:auto}.article-header{margin-bottom:42px}.article-header h1{font-family:Georgia,"Noto Serif SC",serif;font-size:clamp(2.7rem,6vw,5rem);line-height:1.05;font-weight:500;margin:.34em 0 .35em;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.article-deck{color:#c7cad4;font-size:clamp(1.05rem,2vw,1.25rem);line-height:1.7}.article-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem}.blog-article section{margin-top:48px}.blog-article h2{font-family:Georgia,"Noto Serif SC",serif;color:var(--gold);font-size:clamp(1.65rem,3.3vw,2.25rem);line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 18px}.blog-article section p{color:#c7cad4;font-size:1.06rem;line-height:1.9;margin:0 0 1.2em}.blog-article a{color:var(--gold);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}.blog-article figure{margin-top:42px}.blog-article figure img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:cover;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#15182a;box-shadow:0 22px 64px #0007}.blog-article figcaption{color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.6;margin-top:10px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.faq details{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px 0}.faq details:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.faq summary{color:#e6e8ee;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5;cursor:pointer}.faq details p{margin:12px 0 0}
    .champion-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin-top:16px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:8px 16px}.champion-list li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#15182a;border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.92rem;color:#c7cad4;transition:border-color .15s}.champion-list li:hover{border-color:var(--gold)}.champ-id{color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;min-width:32px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.champ-avatar{width:32px;height:32px;object-fit:contain;flex-shrink:0}.champ-name{font-weight:600;color:#e6e8ee}
    .stats-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:24px}.stat-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:24px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:#15182a;border:1px solid var(--line)}.stat-number{font-family:Georgia,"Noto Serif SC",serif;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.6rem);color:var(--gold);font-weight:500;line-height:1}.stat-label{color:var(--muted);font-size:.82rem;text-align:center}
    .blog-breadcrumbs,.blog-article{width:min(var(--content-width),calc(100% - (var(--page-gutter) * 2)))}
    @media(max-width:767px){.blog-breadcrumbs{padding-top:18px}.blog-article{padding:42px 0 76px}.article-header{margin-bottom:28px}.article-header h1{font-size:clamp(2.35rem,12vw,3.4rem)}.blog-article section{margin-top:36px}.blog-article section p{font-size:1rem;line-height:1.78}.champion-list{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}.stats-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}}
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
